   "topic_id": 1,
   "title": "LoRA Fine-Tuning Small Models for Invoice JSON Extraction",
   "description": "An empirical study of LoRA fine-tuning open 1B-3B models to extract invoice fields as JSON. One node sweeps the adapter-side levers: rank and hyperparameters, layers to adapt, synthetic versus real data, and sequence packing, scored by exact-match F1 on real documents. A second holds the adapter fixed and varies the training recipe\u00e2\u20ac\u201dlearning-rate schedule, warmup, mixing in general instruction data, curriculum ordering, embedding freezing\u00e2\u20ac\u201djudged on extraction accuracy and retention of general ability. Together they cover the full tuning pipeline for budget-friendly structured extraction.",
