   "contributor": "0xa9f589e4c15985d751068f65f49801e78b178cf6",
   "title": "Dead Ends in LoRA Fine-Tuning 1B-3B Models for Invoice JSON Extraction",
   "description": "An empirical study of LoRA fine-tuning three open 1B-3B parameter base models to extract invoice fields into JSON. It sweeps adapter rank and related hyperparameters, tests which layers to adapt, compares synthetic versus real training data, and examines sequence packing, with exact-match F1 as the evaluation metric. Readers learn which common configurations waste compute or quietly hurt accuracy on real documents, and get a distilled, budget-friendly setup for structured extraction with small models.",
